# SEIM documentation

- **SSOT:** `documentation/` — manuals, Sphinx (`documentation/sphinx/`), generated API/code/DB output (`documentation/generated/`), and working notes (`documentation/notes/`).
- **Deprecated pointer:** `docs/` — stub README plus a few moved-file stubs. Do not add new manuals there.
- **Not docs:** `documents/` — Django document-upload app. See `documents/README.md`.

When you add or change engineering docs, put them under `documentation/` (guides at the root of that tree; status/audit/working papers under `documentation/notes/`). Keep `make docs-workflow` writing into `documentation/`.
